1
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:40,050
[River of No Return]

2
00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:42,970
[Episode 20 Friends]

3
00:01:55,070 --> 00:01:55,600
General.

4
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:57,120
Leave two guards here

5
00:01:57,229 --> 00:01:58,690
and take the rest with you.

6
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:00,790
No matter who it is today,

7
00:02:00,790 --> 00:02:02,570
make sure they don't make it out alive.

8
00:02:02,570 --> 00:02:03,100
Yes.

9
00:02:11,580 --> 00:02:13,010
The Crown Prince
is in the main room. Follow me.

10
00:02:13,010 --> 00:02:13,480
Okay.

11
00:02:21,700 --> 00:02:22,350
Search!

12
00:02:26,630 --> 00:02:27,140
Stop!

13
00:03:23,660 --> 00:03:25,660
The arrowhead cannot be pulled out.

14
00:03:48,940 --> 00:03:49,590
Jin Si.

15
00:03:50,230 --> 00:03:51,860
Zhu Bukha gave this to me.

16
00:03:51,950 --> 00:03:53,480
You must have a taste of it too.

17
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:54,010
Let's go.

18
00:04:05,130 --> 00:04:06,330
What happened to him?

19
00:04:07,230 --> 00:04:08,830
I blinded him one of his eyes.

20
00:04:09,420 --> 00:04:10,550
Good-for-Nothing.

21
00:04:10,580 --> 00:04:12,110
I knew you were still alive.

22
00:04:12,380 --> 00:04:13,040
How are you?

23
00:04:13,140 --> 00:04:14,370
Did the Iron Alliance
give you a hard time?

24
00:04:14,370 --> 00:04:15,030
No.

25
00:04:15,630 --> 00:04:16,980
You should have gone straight back
to the capital.

26
00:04:16,980 --> 00:04:18,510
Why did you detour to Jinan?

27
00:04:19,140 --> 00:04:20,589
I came to Jinan for other business.

28
00:04:20,589 --> 00:04:21,860
I just saved you in passing.

29
00:04:21,860 --> 00:04:23,260
Don't get the wrong idea.

30
00:04:24,250 --> 00:04:25,720
You're just being stubborn.

31
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:26,760
Cut the nonsense and let's go.

32
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:27,290
Let's go.

33
00:04:27,670 --> 00:04:28,190
Get up!

34
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:53,820
After them!

35
00:04:54,140 --> 00:04:54,800
After them!

36
00:05:15,320 --> 00:05:16,650
Let's fight our way out.

37
00:05:35,140 --> 00:05:36,200
Get him out of here!

38
00:05:36,470 --> 00:05:37,000
Let's go!

39
00:05:37,630 --> 00:05:38,159
Let's go!

40
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:47,760
-Let’s go.
-Move!

41
00:06:04,510 --> 00:06:05,310
Open the door!

42
00:06:07,740 --> 00:06:08,350
Let's go!

43
00:06:11,010 --> 00:06:12,460
Go. Hurry!

44
00:06:16,190 --> 00:06:16,990
Go!

45
00:06:17,140 --> 00:06:18,270
Good-for-Nothing!

46
00:06:24,810 --> 00:06:26,270
-Let’s go!
-Good-for-Nothing!

47
00:06:26,270 --> 00:06:26,760
Come on.

48
00:06:26,780 --> 00:06:27,400
Get out here!

49
00:06:27,400 --> 00:06:27,940
Move!

50
00:06:39,780 --> 00:06:42,580
[Zhongwu Shrine]

51
00:06:41,620 --> 00:06:43,550
You dug the arrowhead out by force.

52
00:06:44,550 --> 00:06:45,880
Do you have a death wish?

53
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:48,810
Your wound keeps tearing open.

54
00:06:49,220 --> 00:06:50,280
If this continues,

55
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:51,650
it might never heal.

56
00:06:54,220 --> 00:06:54,990
Doctor Su.

57
00:06:56,010 --> 00:06:57,540
Sorry to trouble you again.

58
00:06:58,840 --> 00:07:00,500
Do you know what relationship

59
00:07:01,670 --> 00:07:04,270
the Iron Alliance has
with Good-for-Nothing?

60
00:07:18,460 --> 00:07:19,700
If it weren't for him,

61
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:22,310
Young Master Tie would have made it back.

62
00:07:22,310 --> 00:07:23,630
Let's just kill him

63
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:26,200
and trade his head for Young Master Tie.

64
00:07:27,460 --> 00:07:29,920
Don't say such childish things
out of anger.

65
00:07:33,310 --> 00:07:34,460
We meet again.

66
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:39,460
You are the Granny
from the mountain, right?

67
00:07:40,170 --> 00:07:41,070
Little Leaf.

68
00:07:41,710 --> 00:07:42,680
Go out first.

69
00:07:42,960 --> 00:07:44,780
I have something to discuss
with this young man.

70
00:07:44,780 --> 00:07:45,250
But...

71
00:07:45,340 --> 00:07:46,030
Go now.

72
00:07:46,700 --> 00:07:48,820
I met this young man the other day.

73
00:07:49,140 --> 00:07:50,900
He shouldn't be a bad person.

74
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:08,070
Jin Rong must have

75
00:08:08,210 --> 00:08:10,070
locked down the city gates by now.

76
00:08:10,850 --> 00:08:14,700
The Qingzhou Guards under his command
are a formidable cavalry force.

77
00:08:14,700 --> 00:08:18,110
Now you are alone, heavily injured,

78
00:08:18,700 --> 00:08:20,560
and you've fallen into our hands.

79
00:08:20,930 --> 00:08:25,120
You Zhu family members have always
lived in luxury, high above everyone else.

80
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:27,250
Did you ever think this day would come?

81
00:08:27,980 --> 00:08:30,250
The Iron Alliance
hates the imperial court to the bone.

82
00:08:30,250 --> 00:08:31,750
Back when we were in Jinling,

83
00:08:31,750 --> 00:08:34,260
the Iron Alliance was the first
to plot against me.

84
00:08:34,260 --> 00:08:35,990
Now you hesitate to make a move,

85
00:08:36,270 --> 00:08:38,120
and you're chatting with me here.

86
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:38,789
Tell me.

87
00:08:39,530 --> 00:08:40,929
What exactly do you want?

88
00:08:41,789 --> 00:08:42,650
Your Highness.

89
00:08:45,070 --> 00:08:45,910
Please sit.

90
00:08:52,860 --> 00:08:54,190
Do you still remember

91
00:08:54,550 --> 00:08:56,620
what I told you on the mountain?

92
00:08:59,820 --> 00:09:02,150
I have a few questions for you.

93
00:09:02,460 --> 00:09:03,070
Go ahead.

94
00:09:04,170 --> 00:09:06,070
If you really return to Beijing,

95
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:08,220
for what purpose

96
00:09:09,220 --> 00:09:10,750
will you sit on that throne?

97
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:15,590
Why do I want to be the emperor?

98
00:09:15,860 --> 00:09:18,440
Do you realize that
asking that question again

99
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:19,680
is a capital offense?

100
00:09:20,190 --> 00:09:20,740
Speak.

101
00:09:21,530 --> 00:09:23,360
What exactly is the relationship

102
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:25,340
between the Iron Alliance and Wu Dingyuan?

103
00:09:25,340 --> 00:09:28,400
He is the current Alliance Leader
of the Iron Alliance.

104
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:33,490
Alliance Leader of the Iron Alliance?

105
00:09:33,580 --> 00:09:35,670
How could he be
the Alliance Leader of the Iron Alliance?

106
00:09:35,670 --> 00:09:36,980
As for the details,

107
00:09:37,310 --> 00:09:38,550
you can ask him

108
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:39,980
when you see him later.

109
00:09:40,270 --> 00:09:41,670
Along the way,

110
00:09:41,930 --> 00:09:44,360
what kind of world have you seen?

111
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:46,810
Do you see why the common people

112
00:09:47,070 --> 00:09:48,730
believe in the Iron Alliance?

113
00:09:51,530 --> 00:09:53,170
Believe in the Iron Alliance?

114
00:09:53,170 --> 00:09:54,190
It's more like

115
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:55,940
they just want to survive.

116
00:09:59,270 --> 00:10:00,870
Before arriving in Jinling,

117
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:03,100
I always thought the strength of a nation

118
00:10:03,100 --> 00:10:05,100
lay in military might and strategy.

119
00:10:05,100 --> 00:10:06,820
One must be well-versed in the classics
and understand righteousness,

120
00:10:06,820 --> 00:10:08,480
with a clear strategy in mind.

121
00:10:11,410 --> 00:10:13,270
But on the way back to the capital,

122
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,970
I saw so many people living in poverty.

123
00:10:20,900 --> 00:10:23,360
They were not just
empty words in memorials,

124
00:10:26,260 --> 00:10:27,680
but real humans

125
00:10:29,820 --> 00:10:31,100
living in suffering.

126
00:10:32,640 --> 00:10:33,890
When I was in Huai'an,

127
00:10:34,750 --> 00:10:36,510
the boat trackers I saw

128
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:38,850
were actually no different

129
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:40,950
from your subordinates.

130
00:10:41,820 --> 00:10:43,280
Their leader, Kong Shiba,

131
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:46,120
was originally a scout on the battlefield.

132
00:10:46,580 --> 00:10:48,700
But just for a bite to eat,

133
00:10:49,570 --> 00:10:51,240
they had to spend all day on the dam,

134
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:53,300
suffering humiliation and torture.

135
00:10:54,460 --> 00:10:57,120
When I witnessed
the suffering of those people,

136
00:10:58,170 --> 00:10:59,370
the hatred in my heart

137
00:11:01,030 --> 00:11:02,290
was no less than yours.

138
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:04,190
So you ask me

139
00:11:04,700 --> 00:11:06,830
why they believe in the Iron Alliance.

140
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:08,190
I only know that

141
00:11:10,100 --> 00:11:11,650
they want to survive.

142
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:17,150
Then do you think

143
00:11:18,570 --> 00:11:20,070
they are pitiful,

144
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:22,300
or do you think that

145
00:11:23,170 --> 00:11:25,030
the world shouldn't be like this?

146
00:11:27,570 --> 00:11:28,400
I know

147
00:11:29,060 --> 00:11:30,780
what your members think.

148
00:11:31,880 --> 00:11:33,390
It's nothing more than
cursing the Zhu family

149
00:11:33,390 --> 00:11:36,390
for making wrong decisions
and issuing wrong decrees.

150
00:11:36,390 --> 00:11:38,730
Although I don't agree
with Father moving the capital,

151
00:11:38,730 --> 00:11:40,160
he is definitely not

152
00:11:40,740 --> 00:11:42,000
an incompetent person

153
00:11:42,980 --> 00:11:44,580
who doesn't love his people.

154
00:11:45,100 --> 00:11:48,050
The people I met along the way
were hardworking and simple.

155
00:11:48,050 --> 00:11:50,850
They weren't seeking
to rise above their station,

156
00:11:51,170 --> 00:11:53,370
nor were they chasing wealth and glory.

157
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:55,460
All they wanted

158
00:11:57,820 --> 00:11:59,150
was a bite to eat

159
00:12:00,390 --> 00:12:01,920
and a roof over their heads.

160
00:12:02,450 --> 00:12:03,980
The suffering of the people

161
00:12:04,150 --> 00:12:05,700
cannot be fully understood

162
00:12:07,430 --> 00:12:09,430
without witnessing it for oneself.

163
00:12:10,190 --> 00:12:12,820
Then I have one last question.

164
00:12:14,160 --> 00:12:16,090
How do you view friends?

165
00:12:18,460 --> 00:12:19,190
Friends?

166
00:12:21,530 --> 00:12:22,500
People like me

167
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:25,010
didn't need friends to begin with.

168
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:27,980
But along the way,

169
00:12:28,820 --> 00:12:30,910
I did make a few friends.

170
00:12:41,490 --> 00:12:44,150
Wu Dingyuan saved me
from danger several times.

171
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:45,480
Therefore, I must

172
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:47,030
save him.

173
00:12:47,340 --> 00:12:50,190
Even if it delays
your return to the capital?

174
00:12:50,740 --> 00:12:51,700
In this life,

175
00:12:54,340 --> 00:12:56,800
we must follow our heart
for certain things.

176
00:13:04,790 --> 00:13:08,150
Young Master Tie was right about you.

177
00:13:10,170 --> 00:13:12,100
Regardless of the circumstances,

178
00:13:13,390 --> 00:13:16,120
I gave the order
to assassinate the Crown Prince.

179
00:13:17,640 --> 00:13:19,400
This huge mistake

180
00:13:20,570 --> 00:13:22,070
is mine alone.

181
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:31,840
Old Madam,

182
00:13:32,050 --> 00:13:34,180
there's no need for such formalities.

183
00:13:35,550 --> 00:13:37,150
If you want to blame someone,

184
00:13:38,200 --> 00:13:39,340
blame this world.

185
00:13:40,860 --> 00:13:41,720
Your Highness.

186
00:13:44,480 --> 00:13:45,840
Those people

187
00:13:46,430 --> 00:13:49,340
never intended to overthrow the court.

188
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:51,820
They really had no other way out.

189
00:13:53,580 --> 00:13:54,440
Your Highness,

190
00:13:56,450 --> 00:13:58,250
after hearing your words today,

191
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:01,340
I believe you.

192
00:14:16,690 --> 00:14:17,620
Open the door.

193
00:14:28,100 --> 00:14:29,150
Little Leaf.

194
00:14:37,550 --> 00:14:38,980
From this moment on,

195
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:41,440
yesterday's matters

196
00:14:41,770 --> 00:14:42,900
are left in the past.

197
00:14:44,170 --> 00:14:45,670
Zuo Yehe, hear my command.

198
00:14:46,390 --> 00:14:50,450
Do your best to help the Crown Prince
rescue the new Iron Alliance Leader,

199
00:14:51,030 --> 00:14:52,220
Wu Dingyuan.

200
00:14:59,150 --> 00:15:01,030
We rise tonight.

201
00:15:03,030 --> 00:15:05,310
We pledge our lives!

202
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:07,190
We pledge our lives!

203
00:15:07,550 --> 00:15:08,910
We pledge our lives!

204
00:15:09,240 --> 00:15:10,550
We pledge our lives!

205
00:15:10,950 --> 00:15:12,340
We pledge our lives!

206
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:14,150
We pledge our lives!

207
00:15:14,550 --> 00:15:16,030
We pledge our lives!

208
00:15:55,670 --> 00:15:56,950
The Iron Alliance has few people,

209
00:15:56,950 --> 00:15:58,720
while Jin Rong has many soldiers.

210
00:15:58,720 --> 00:16:00,920
The disparity in strength is too great.

211
00:16:01,030 --> 00:16:02,550
What are you talking about?

212
00:16:02,550 --> 00:16:04,330
The Iron Alliance has been
operating in Jinan for so long.

213
00:16:04,330 --> 00:16:06,060
We can easily get a few cannons.

214
00:16:06,470 --> 00:16:07,400
What do you mean?

215
00:16:08,220 --> 00:16:09,480
You're using cannons?

216
00:16:09,740 --> 00:16:12,000
Wouldn't that mean mutual destruction?

217
00:16:12,640 --> 00:16:14,040
Things have come to this.

218
00:16:14,190 --> 00:16:16,590
If we have to burn everything down,
so be it.

219
00:16:16,790 --> 00:16:17,740
Are you crazy?

220
00:16:18,170 --> 00:16:19,960
We've worked so hard
to make it this far,

221
00:16:19,960 --> 00:16:20,820
and you're just

222
00:16:21,010 --> 00:16:22,890
planning to burn and destroy everything?

223
00:16:22,890 --> 00:16:25,480
You've made it this far,
but what about us?

224
00:16:29,390 --> 00:16:30,790
Things have come to this.

225
00:16:31,390 --> 00:16:34,520
The Alliance Leader
will definitely agree to it gladly.

226
00:16:35,100 --> 00:16:36,300
You're really crazy.

227
00:16:37,950 --> 00:16:39,670
Envoy, Envoy.

228
00:16:40,150 --> 00:16:40,620
Speak.

229
00:16:40,920 --> 00:16:42,400
A landslide on the north road

230
00:16:42,400 --> 00:16:44,130
has blocked our retreat route.

231
00:16:46,220 --> 00:16:47,750
How long will it take to clear?

232
00:16:47,750 --> 00:16:50,880
If we work through the night,
we can clear it within a day.

233
00:16:51,550 --> 00:16:52,680
We are outnumbered.

234
00:16:53,060 --> 00:16:54,760
We must catch them off guard to win.

235
00:16:54,760 --> 00:16:55,440
Remember,

236
00:16:55,820 --> 00:16:57,220
don't drag out the fight.

237
00:16:57,770 --> 00:16:58,700
Find Wu Dingyuan

238
00:16:58,750 --> 00:17:00,210
and retreat immediately.

239
00:17:00,860 --> 00:17:02,460
Where else can we retreat to?

240
00:17:02,540 --> 00:17:03,280
Go north.

241
00:17:04,190 --> 00:17:06,540
The Qingzhou soldiers
will definitely pursue us.

242
00:17:06,540 --> 00:17:08,109
While we are escaping,

243
00:17:08,410 --> 00:17:10,140
try to hold them off for a while.

244
00:17:10,589 --> 00:17:11,220
Doctor Su.

245
00:17:11,960 --> 00:17:13,480
I have a favor to ask.

246
00:17:14,369 --> 00:17:15,720
Please speak, Your Highness.

247
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:17,300
You and the members of the Iron Alliance,

248
00:17:17,300 --> 00:17:19,359
go prepare some bows and fire arrows.

249
00:17:20,060 --> 00:17:20,740
Remember.

250
00:17:21,329 --> 00:17:22,790
On the north slope of the drill ground,

251
00:17:22,790 --> 00:17:23,980
there is a thatched cottage.

252
00:17:23,980 --> 00:17:24,980
Wait for us there.

253
00:17:26,849 --> 00:17:28,109
I also need you guys

254
00:17:28,760 --> 00:17:30,690
to find some highly flammable oil.

255
00:17:31,800 --> 00:17:32,390
Okay.

256
00:17:33,530 --> 00:17:34,460
Leave this to me.

257
00:17:35,040 --> 00:17:35,580
Okay.

258
00:18:08,220 --> 00:18:09,350
Who exactly are you?

259
00:18:10,770 --> 00:18:13,140
What's your relationship
with the Iron Alliance?

260
00:18:13,140 --> 00:18:15,770
How did you meet the Crown Prince?

261
00:18:17,170 --> 00:18:18,300
What does any of this

262
00:18:18,500 --> 00:18:20,670
have to do with an old bastard like you?

263
00:18:21,240 --> 00:18:22,440
If you want to kill me,

264
00:18:22,600 --> 00:18:23,600
just make it quick

265
00:18:24,150 --> 00:18:25,810
so I can become a ghost sooner.

266
00:18:26,110 --> 00:18:26,970
Remember this.

267
00:18:27,080 --> 00:18:28,280
Once I become a ghost,

268
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:30,010
I will come back for you.

269
00:18:32,510 --> 00:18:34,840
I've seen many people
like you in the army.

270
00:18:35,540 --> 00:18:36,470
You're stubborn

271
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:37,540
and loud.

272
00:18:37,930 --> 00:18:39,260
Do you know how herdsmen

273
00:18:39,830 --> 00:18:41,220
catch wolves?

274
00:18:42,220 --> 00:18:42,780
Tell me.

275
00:18:46,150 --> 00:18:47,830
You just need to catch one,

276
00:18:48,700 --> 00:18:49,780
tie it to a tree,

277
00:18:51,130 --> 00:18:51,930
keep it alive,

278
00:18:53,610 --> 00:18:56,110
and tighten the rope bit by bit.

279
00:18:57,540 --> 00:18:58,940
When the wolf feels pain,

280
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:00,260
it howls loudly.

281
00:19:02,260 --> 00:19:04,190
At this time, its parents,

282
00:19:04,350 --> 00:19:06,740
brothers, sisters, and cubs

283
00:19:06,760 --> 00:19:08,660
will all run over at once.

284
00:19:09,640 --> 00:19:11,110
Wolves look fierce,

285
00:19:11,870 --> 00:19:13,800
but they are actually very stupid.

286
00:19:14,130 --> 00:19:15,220
They can't even tell

287
00:19:15,220 --> 00:19:17,480
whether the howl is from one of their own,

288
00:19:17,690 --> 00:19:19,620
but they all rush over as if it were.

289
00:19:21,220 --> 00:19:24,020
So you just need to catch one

290
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:28,810
to wipe out a whole pack.

291
00:19:33,020 --> 00:19:35,390
That was how we took Jinan City back then.

292
00:19:36,750 --> 00:19:38,120
Capture one soldier,

293
00:19:39,170 --> 00:19:41,030
and you can get a city gate opened.

294
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:42,800
Oh, right.

295
00:19:44,220 --> 00:19:47,910
Tie Xuan also surrendered
and died like that.

296
00:19:49,070 --> 00:19:50,730
Extremely stupid, wasn't it?

297
00:19:55,390 --> 00:19:58,560
A military ruffian like you
has no right to talk about him like that.

298
00:19:58,560 --> 00:19:59,910
Young Master Tie.

299
00:20:01,890 --> 00:20:03,550
You are just like your father,

300
00:20:04,150 --> 00:20:05,780
down to the bad temper.

301
00:20:08,430 --> 00:20:09,960
Since you know everything,

302
00:20:10,330 --> 00:20:11,830
cut the crap.

303
00:20:14,130 --> 00:20:15,330
I'm just curious.

304
00:20:15,710 --> 00:20:17,890
I was thinking, if the Crown Prince

305
00:20:18,430 --> 00:20:19,890
didn't know your identity

306
00:20:20,010 --> 00:20:22,070
and took a detour to Jinan to save you,

307
00:20:22,190 --> 00:20:23,720
that'd make him very loyal.

308
00:20:24,200 --> 00:20:25,430
But if he

309
00:20:25,540 --> 00:20:28,260
knew your identity
and still came to save you,

310
00:20:29,630 --> 00:20:31,560
that'd make him extremely stupid.

311
00:20:33,790 --> 00:20:36,920
But I like both scenarios.

312
00:20:38,500 --> 00:20:39,700
I just want to see

313
00:20:40,430 --> 00:20:42,550
how many companions
a little wolf cub like you

314
00:20:42,550 --> 00:20:44,240
can attract.

315
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:12,150
Check everyone's identification token.

316
00:21:12,150 --> 00:21:13,700
See if there are any unfamiliar faces.

317
00:21:13,700 --> 00:21:14,700
Don't let them in.

318
00:21:20,760 --> 00:21:21,360
You may go.

319
00:21:41,920 --> 00:21:42,960
Regional Military Commander.

320
00:21:42,960 --> 00:21:44,660
The fodder and the supply convoys
have all been inspected.

321
00:21:44,660 --> 00:21:46,540
No suspicious persons were found.

322
00:21:46,540 --> 00:21:48,340
Go search the nearby mountains.

323
00:21:48,630 --> 00:21:49,960
I know the Crown Prince.

324
00:21:50,040 --> 00:21:52,360
He likes to win
with the element of surprise.

325
00:21:52,360 --> 00:21:52,890
Yes.

326
00:22:21,720 --> 00:22:22,690
Regional Military Commander.

327
00:22:22,690 --> 00:22:23,980
We have searched the mountain

328
00:22:23,980 --> 00:22:25,580
and found no one suspicious.

329
00:22:26,150 --> 00:22:27,550
It seems the Crown Prince

330
00:22:28,220 --> 00:22:30,060
is giving up on Wu Dingyuan.

331
00:22:30,460 --> 00:22:31,720
What should we do then?

332
00:22:34,090 --> 00:22:35,950
If the Crown Prince doesn't come,

333
00:22:36,800 --> 00:22:38,260
we'll take him to Beijing.

334
00:22:39,220 --> 00:22:42,280
When His Highness the Prince of Han
ascends the throne,

335
00:22:42,950 --> 00:22:45,280
we will sacrifice Wu Dingyuan to the flag.

336
00:22:46,460 --> 00:22:47,320
Keep watching.

337
00:22:47,680 --> 00:22:48,180
Yes.

338
00:22:58,950 --> 00:23:00,280
Push harder, brothers!

339
00:23:01,870 --> 00:23:03,130
Come on, load the ammo!

340
00:23:04,700 --> 00:23:05,390
Hurry up!

341
00:23:05,690 --> 00:23:06,720
-Hurry!
-Hurry up!

342
00:23:06,720 --> 00:23:07,390
Hurry!

343
00:23:08,200 --> 00:23:10,000
Pack it tight!

344
00:23:11,390 --> 00:23:12,740
-Pack it tight!
-Hurry!

345
00:23:16,110 --> 00:23:17,060
Hurry!

346
00:23:18,350 --> 00:23:19,150
Push hard!

347
00:23:19,850 --> 00:23:20,380
Come on!

348
00:23:22,390 --> 00:23:23,150
Ready?

349
00:23:24,650 --> 00:23:25,240
Is it ready?

350
00:23:25,240 --> 00:23:26,250
-Ready!
-It's ready!

351
00:23:26,250 --> 00:23:27,450
-Ready!
-Pack it tight!

352
00:23:27,450 --> 00:23:28,310
Light the fuse.

353
00:23:29,600 --> 00:23:31,330
Everyone, wait for my command!

354
00:23:31,480 --> 00:23:32,110
Yes, sir!

355
00:23:36,540 --> 00:23:37,150
Fire!

356
00:23:43,560 --> 00:23:44,890
-Get down!
-Get down!

357
00:23:57,840 --> 00:23:59,140
♪ He said my life is worthless ♪

358
00:23:59,170 --> 00:24:00,320
♪ Then I'll stake everything I own ♪

359
00:24:00,350 --> 00:24:01,440
♪ Bet on a world
that is clear and bright ♪

360
00:24:01,470 --> 00:24:02,660
♪ And fulfill the promises made ♪

361
00:24:02,680 --> 00:24:03,830
♪ Turbulent waves
surge and batter the old hull ♪

362
00:24:03,850 --> 00:24:05,040
♪ Capturing life and death
within the silt and sand ♪

363
00:24:05,060 --> 00:24:06,130
♪ Not for fame, fortune, or status ♪

364
00:24:06,160 --> 00:24:07,270
♪ Just for the dawn’s first light ♪

365
00:24:07,290 --> 00:24:08,290
♪ If you hadn’t seen it yourself ♪

366
00:24:08,310 --> 00:24:09,530
♪ You'd surely be unaware ♪

367
00:24:09,700 --> 00:24:11,010
♪ The world is not determined by
words on an imperial decree ♪

368
00:24:11,040 --> 00:24:12,090
♪ Or boundaries on the map ♪

369
00:24:12,120 --> 00:24:13,350
♪ May I die for something worthwhile ♪

370
00:24:13,380 --> 00:24:14,380
♪ And live without starvation ♪

371
00:24:14,410 --> 00:24:15,470
♪ If the world can be changed ♪

372
00:24:15,490 --> 00:24:16,840
♪ Leave this page out of history ♪

373
00:24:17,010 --> 00:24:21,070
♪ Heading north a thousand miles,
treading the surging waves ♪

374
00:24:21,740 --> 00:24:25,750
♪ Fierce winds and driving rain
don't matter ♪

375
00:24:25,950 --> 00:24:28,180
♪ Undercurrents surge,
sails sway and toss ♪

376
00:24:28,210 --> 00:24:30,670
♪ Even with inescapable traps
set all around ♪

377
00:24:30,820 --> 00:24:35,220
♪ Still, we'll forge
a new chapter for the Ming Empire ♪

378
00:24:57,940 --> 00:24:59,670
Regional Military Commander!

379
00:25:00,370 --> 00:25:01,190
Regional Military Commander,

380
00:25:01,190 --> 00:25:02,090
the Iron Alliance is here.

381
00:25:02,090 --> 00:25:02,540
Should we set up the formation?

382
00:25:02,540 --> 00:25:03,300
Where is the Crown Prince?

383
00:25:03,300 --> 00:25:05,360
We haven't seen the Crown Prince yet.

384
00:25:06,110 --> 00:25:07,310
Wait a little longer.

385
00:25:07,520 --> 00:25:08,020
Yes, Sir.

386
00:25:08,020 --> 00:25:08,540
Go.

387
00:25:49,990 --> 00:25:50,990
Get out of the way!

388
00:26:28,520 --> 00:26:29,610
Regional Military Commander!

389
00:26:29,610 --> 00:26:31,010
The Crown Prince is here.

390
00:26:42,190 --> 00:26:44,050
Your Highness, the Crown Prince.

391
00:26:44,440 --> 00:26:46,700
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

392
00:26:47,800 --> 00:26:48,390
Jin Rong.

393
00:26:48,830 --> 00:26:49,630
Let him go.

394
00:26:49,900 --> 00:26:52,450
If you think
you can still leave here today,

395
00:26:52,990 --> 00:26:54,710
you're sorely mistaken.

396
00:27:16,500 --> 00:27:18,120
Your Highness, do you know exactly

397
00:27:18,120 --> 00:27:19,600
who you are saving?

398
00:27:20,870 --> 00:27:22,270
If you knew his identity,

399
00:27:22,540 --> 00:27:24,670
I believe you'd definitely regret it.

400
00:27:31,020 --> 00:27:31,870
Regret?

401
00:27:32,700 --> 00:27:33,980
If I regretted it,

402
00:27:34,740 --> 00:27:36,200
I wouldn't have come back.

403
00:27:38,950 --> 00:27:40,680
Once I set my mind on something,

404
00:27:40,950 --> 00:27:43,650
I will fight for it
even through hell and high water.

405
00:27:43,650 --> 00:27:45,150
I will have no fear.

406
00:27:45,760 --> 00:27:46,890
Just like back then,

407
00:27:47,300 --> 00:27:49,590
when I risked my life outside the pass.

408
00:27:50,260 --> 00:27:51,020
This,

409
00:27:52,480 --> 00:27:54,220
you should know very well.

410
00:28:05,020 --> 00:28:05,830
Jin Si.

411
00:28:07,430 --> 00:28:08,260
Tell me.

412
00:28:08,830 --> 00:28:10,890
Every emperor has his own courtiers.

413
00:28:11,220 --> 00:28:12,740
Do you think you can

414
00:28:13,220 --> 00:28:14,190
really hold onto

415
00:28:14,280 --> 00:28:15,890
this military power forever?

416
00:28:15,890 --> 00:28:18,220
Your current military merits, prestige,

417
00:28:18,430 --> 00:28:19,830
and the glory of your men,

418
00:28:22,410 --> 00:28:24,470
were all earned under Grandfather's

419
00:28:24,700 --> 00:28:27,520
policy of defending the realm
and securing the state.

420
00:28:27,520 --> 00:28:28,800
I know in my heart

421
00:28:29,420 --> 00:28:31,950
that your loyalty to Grandfather
is genuine.

422
00:28:32,540 --> 00:28:33,940
If there are no more wars,

423
00:28:34,700 --> 00:28:36,670
your position as
Regional Military Commander

424
00:28:36,670 --> 00:28:38,220
will exist in name only.

425
00:28:38,830 --> 00:28:39,670
Just like

426
00:28:39,850 --> 00:28:41,450
these little birds you keep.

427
00:28:42,240 --> 00:28:44,760
They were meant to go out
and forage every day.

428
00:28:44,760 --> 00:28:45,540
Instead,

429
00:28:46,240 --> 00:28:48,840
they're being locked up here
to live in luxury.

430
00:28:49,060 --> 00:28:50,220
Over time,

431
00:28:51,060 --> 00:28:52,660
they have lost that ability.

432
00:28:54,060 --> 00:28:55,300
So, Jin Si,

433
00:28:56,430 --> 00:28:57,700
I understand

434
00:28:58,410 --> 00:29:00,070
the resentment in your heart.

435
00:29:13,460 --> 00:29:15,520
For Your Highness to say such things,

436
00:29:16,190 --> 00:29:17,990
you must truly mean what you say.

437
00:29:24,350 --> 00:29:25,430
Actually, Jin Si,

438
00:29:26,020 --> 00:29:27,700
I've never figured out

439
00:29:29,040 --> 00:29:30,700
what benefits my second uncle

440
00:29:30,890 --> 00:29:32,720
promised you

441
00:29:33,720 --> 00:29:35,580
to make you sacrifice everything

442
00:29:37,460 --> 00:29:39,150
to help him ascend the throne.

443
00:29:39,760 --> 00:29:41,490
Have you ever thought about it?

444
00:29:41,630 --> 00:29:43,690
Even if he really ascends the throne,

445
00:29:44,570 --> 00:29:46,090
can your name

446
00:29:47,240 --> 00:29:49,170
be written into the history books?

447
00:30:04,450 --> 00:30:05,540
Your silence

448
00:30:05,710 --> 00:30:07,710
tells me you've thought it through.

449
00:30:07,890 --> 00:30:10,110
You are an official
from outside the imperial clan.

450
00:30:10,110 --> 00:30:12,060
Even if you make
great contributions today,

451
00:30:12,060 --> 00:30:12,830
tomorrow,

452
00:30:13,910 --> 00:30:16,840
you will still have to hand over
your military power.

453
00:30:18,130 --> 00:30:18,830
Also,

454
00:30:19,680 --> 00:30:22,050
do you think he would entrust
command of the Northern Expedition

455
00:30:22,050 --> 00:30:24,440
to someone who knows his secrets?

456
00:30:26,030 --> 00:30:28,750
I'm afraid that
after all your twists and turns,

457
00:30:30,060 --> 00:30:30,980
you may not even

458
00:30:31,560 --> 00:30:34,670
retain the merit of having helped him
seize the throne.

459
00:30:38,430 --> 00:30:39,740
Emperor Taizong

460
00:30:41,150 --> 00:30:43,150
really had foresight.

461
00:30:49,720 --> 00:30:51,120
However, Your Highness,

462
00:30:51,390 --> 00:30:53,190
whether it was Tie Xuan back then

463
00:30:53,300 --> 00:30:54,540
or Wu Dingyuan now,

464
00:30:54,910 --> 00:30:56,770
they are ultimately liabilities

465
00:30:57,150 --> 00:30:58,810
to you and the imperial court.

466
00:30:59,240 --> 00:31:00,060
I hope you

467
00:31:00,790 --> 00:31:01,730
will give him up.

468
00:31:08,300 --> 00:31:09,060
Jin Si,

469
00:31:10,110 --> 00:31:11,840
do you still remember back then

470
00:31:12,020 --> 00:31:14,420
when we risked our lives
on the battlefield

471
00:31:14,610 --> 00:31:16,940
and ate Tied Braised Pork Belly together?

472
00:31:20,150 --> 00:31:20,980
In the end,

473
00:31:22,480 --> 00:31:23,630
in this world,

474
00:31:25,530 --> 00:31:27,290
what matters is just one thing:

475
00:31:29,390 --> 00:31:30,850
the bonds between people.

476
00:31:49,390 --> 00:31:50,190
Wu Dingyuan

477
00:31:52,130 --> 00:31:53,590
is in the dungeon outside.

478
00:32:05,960 --> 00:32:07,460
Old Mule, are you an idiot?

479
00:32:07,490 --> 00:32:08,190
Not dead?

480
00:32:09,300 --> 00:32:10,740
You finally escaped.

481
00:32:10,830 --> 00:32:12,630
Why did you walk straight into the trap?

482
00:32:12,630 --> 00:32:13,960
Do you have a death wish,

483
00:32:14,280 --> 00:32:15,990
or is my life that precious to you?

484
00:32:15,990 --> 00:32:17,250
Who walked into a trap?

485
00:32:17,450 --> 00:32:19,180
Jin Rong didn't lock you up here

486
00:32:19,190 --> 00:32:20,850
because he wanted to kill you.

487
00:32:20,890 --> 00:32:22,620
He was waiting for me to show up.

488
00:32:26,150 --> 00:32:27,190
So he kept you here

489
00:32:27,250 --> 00:32:28,620
to negotiate with me.

490
00:32:37,440 --> 00:32:38,050
Move.

491
00:32:42,350 --> 00:32:43,350
Aren't you afraid

492
00:32:43,400 --> 00:32:44,640
he'll bury you too?

493
00:32:46,000 --> 00:32:46,910
That bastard

494
00:32:47,760 --> 00:32:48,740
has it all

495
00:32:49,310 --> 00:32:50,090
figured out.

496
00:32:50,730 --> 00:32:51,590
If he kills you,

497
00:32:52,190 --> 00:32:54,700
he'll make an enemy of the Iron Alliance.

498
00:32:55,320 --> 00:32:56,120
If he kills me,

499
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:58,850
he'll make an enemy of the whole world.

500
00:33:01,220 --> 00:33:01,830
Let's go.

501
00:33:39,300 --> 00:33:41,230
General Jin, you are in a good mood.

502
00:33:42,940 --> 00:33:44,470
Young Master, you're here.

503
00:33:46,500 --> 00:33:50,590
You are a veteran
who has fought many battles, General.

504
00:33:51,800 --> 00:33:54,610
The vanguard cavalry
in the Battle of Baigou River,

505
00:33:54,610 --> 00:33:56,940
the rear flank in the Battle of Dongchang,

506
00:33:57,890 --> 00:34:00,550
and the flying cavalry
in the Battle of Puzikou.

507
00:34:00,690 --> 00:34:02,620
The military merits of each battle

508
00:34:03,180 --> 00:34:05,640
are worthy of your lifelong pride,
General.

509
00:34:08,280 --> 00:34:10,800
So the situation outside this tent

510
00:34:11,460 --> 00:34:13,159
must have been caused by more than just

511
00:34:13,159 --> 00:34:15,159
a few remnants of the Iron Alliance.

512
00:34:17,949 --> 00:34:18,980
Zhu Zhanji

513
00:34:21,020 --> 00:34:22,830
is a man chosen by destiny.

514
00:34:23,810 --> 00:34:25,739
I, Jin Rong, made the wrong choice.

515
00:34:31,210 --> 00:34:32,730
Are you scared, General?

516
00:34:33,600 --> 00:34:36,580
Even if you kneel down and beg
the Crown Prince for forgiveness now,

517
00:34:36,580 --> 00:34:39,100
you will definitely
be purged in the future.

518
00:34:40,179 --> 00:34:42,199
Are you going to betray my Father?

519
00:34:45,960 --> 00:34:47,730
I didn't do all this

520
00:34:47,730 --> 00:34:49,929
to throw in my lot with the Prince of Han.

521
00:34:50,830 --> 00:34:53,230
I misjudged His Highness the Crown Prince.

522
00:34:53,449 --> 00:34:55,139
He will be a wise ruler.

523
00:34:57,770 --> 00:35:00,650
I will personally atone
before Emperor Taizong.

524
00:35:14,380 --> 00:35:16,960
Then you can go and see Grandfather now.

525
00:35:25,230 --> 00:35:26,410
-Alliance Leader!
-Alliance Leader!

526
00:35:26,410 --> 00:35:28,440
-Your Highness!
-Your Highness!

527
00:35:29,210 --> 00:35:30,730
Bring General Jin out.

528
00:35:41,600 --> 00:35:43,330
Seize those scoundrels!

529
00:35:53,160 --> 00:35:53,750
General!

530
00:35:53,910 --> 00:35:55,170
-General!
-Everyone.

531
00:35:55,390 --> 00:35:57,460
Your General Jin was killed

532
00:35:57,620 --> 00:35:59,540
by those scoundrels in his tent,

533
00:35:59,660 --> 00:36:01,790
and you remained completely unaware.

534
00:36:02,180 --> 00:36:02,870
Now,

535
00:36:03,390 --> 00:36:06,270
will you bow to those
Iron Alliance remnants,

536
00:36:06,810 --> 00:36:08,660
or will you avenge General Jin?

537
00:36:13,460 --> 00:36:15,020
Avenge the general!

538
00:36:30,430 --> 00:36:31,180
Go!

539
00:36:31,830 --> 00:36:33,710
Leave things here to me!

540
00:36:43,680 --> 00:36:44,210
Let's go.

541
00:36:52,400 --> 00:36:53,080
Mr. Liang.

542
00:36:55,510 --> 00:36:56,840
Go, Good-for-Nothing.

543
00:36:57,060 --> 00:36:57,590
Let's go!

544
00:36:57,990 --> 00:36:58,530
Let's go!

545
00:37:35,770 --> 00:37:37,030
-Let’s go!
-Mr. Liang!

546
00:37:37,060 --> 00:37:37,620
Let's go!

547
00:37:38,330 --> 00:37:39,310
Mr. Liang!

548
00:37:49,510 --> 00:37:50,470
Mr. Liang!

549
00:37:50,830 --> 00:37:51,360
Let's go!

550
00:38:02,290 --> 00:38:02,850
Let's go!

551
00:38:04,410 --> 00:38:05,580
Mr. Liang!

552
00:38:38,890 --> 00:38:39,550
After them!

553
00:39:04,810 --> 00:39:06,170
Little Leaf...

554
00:39:09,230 --> 00:39:10,060
This is...

555
00:39:18,600 --> 00:39:25,780
♪ The Bian River flows,
the Si River flows ♪

556
00:39:26,770 --> 00:39:33,840
♪ Converging at
the ancient Guazhou Ferry ♪

557
00:39:28,120 --> 00:39:30,120
Little Leaf...

558
00:39:33,480 --> 00:39:38,430
This is...

559
00:39:34,760 --> 00:39:42,420
♪ The Bian River flows,
the Si River flows ♪

560
00:39:39,100 --> 00:39:39,750
Your...

561
00:39:40,890 --> 00:39:41,430
Your...

562
00:39:42,250 --> 00:39:44,540
Favorite childhood snack...

563
00:39:42,970 --> 00:39:50,660
♪ Converging at
the ancient Guazhou Ferry ♪

